    "summary": "This document is a product catalog for the Power Aire Series CQ2 Large Bore Compact Cylinder, with diameters of 180mm and 200mm. It details the features, specifications, and ordering information for single and double rod versions. The catalog includes technical data such as dimensions, standard strokes, weight, and theoretical output. It also provides comprehensive information on applicable auto switches, including various models of reed and solid-state switches. Instructions for mounting, wiring diagrams, and parts lists with construction details are also included.",
