The maximum operating pressure for the Series CQ2 compact cylinder depends on the bore size (series-cq2-a-b-compact-cylinder-double-acting-single-rod-en-eu.pdf, p. 1, Specifications).

*   For bore sizes from ø12 to ø100, the maximum operating pressure is 1.0 MPa (series-cq2-a-b-compact-cylinder-double-acting-single-rod-en-eu.pdf, p. 1, Specifications).
*   For bore sizes from ø125 to ø200, it is 0.7 MPa (series-cq2-a-b-compact-cylinder-double-acting-single-rod-en-eu.pdf, p. 1, Specifications).
