{"parts":[{"function_response":{"name":"document_ingestion_agent","response":{"result":"```json\n{\n  \"artifact_e-e1d9d6dd-838e-4642-aba4-f28ee900aa35_1\": {\n    \"mime_type\": \"application/pdf\",\n    \"summary\": \"This document is a product catalog for the Power Aire Series CQ2 Large Bore Compact Cylinder, with diameters of 180mm and 200mm. It details the features, specifications, and ordering information for single and double rod versions. The catalog includes technical data such as dimensions, standard strokes, weight, and theoretical output. It also provides comprehensive information on applicable auto switches, including various models of reed and solid-state switches. Instructions for mounting, wiring diagrams, and parts lists with construction details are also included.\",\n    \"notes\": [\n      \"The document provides detailed specifications for Contact Protection Boxes, specifically models CD-P11 and CD-P12, on page 15.\",\n      \"CD-P11 is designed for AC loads (100V/200V), while CD-P12 is for 24VDC loads.\",\n      \"These protection boxes are recommended for use with D-Z7 and D-Z8 type switches when the load is inductive, wiring is 5m or longer, or the load voltage is 100VAC.\",\n      \"Internal circuit diagrams and connection instructions for the protection boxes are provided.\"\n    ],\n    \"characters\": 27339,\n    \"version\": null\n  }\n}\n```"}}}],"role":"user"}
