{"parts":[{"function_response":{"name":"file_qa_agent","response":{"result":"Based on the document provided, here is the information about Contact Protection Boxes CD-P11 and CD-P12:\n\nThese boxes are accessories designed for specific OMRON relays (OMRON_General-purpose-Relay_MK-I_Datasheet.pdf, page 6).\n\n*   **Applicable Relays:** Both the CD-P11 and CD-P12 are suitable for use with the MK2(P)-I, MK2KP-I, MK3(P)-I, and MK3(P)5-I relay models (OMRON_General-purpose-Relay_MK-I_Datasheet.pdf, page 6).\n*   **Contact Voltage:**\n    *   **CD-P11:** Designed for a contact voltage of 100 to 120 VAC (OMRON_General-purpose-Relay_MK-I_Datasheet.pdf, page 6).\n    *   **CD-P12:** Designed for a contact voltage of 200 to 240 VAC (OMRON_General-purpose-Relay_MK-I_Datasheet.pdf, page 6).\n\nThe datasheet also includes dimensional diagrams for both models (OMRON_General-purpose-Relay_MK-I_Datasheet.pdf, page 6)."}}}],"role":"user"}
