*   For bore sizes from ø12 to ø100, the maximum operating pressure is **1.0 MPa** (SMC_CQ2_catalog.pdf, p. 2, Specifications table).
*   For bore sizes from ø125 to ø200, the maximum operating pressure is **0.7 MPa** (SMC_CQ2_catalog.pdf, p. 2, Specifications table).
