uids like deionized water, chemical fluids, and inert gases.\\n- **Materials**: The wetted parts are constructed from high-purity materials, specifically a PTFE diaphragm and a New PFA body.\\n- **Limit Switch Details**: The integrated limit switch is a normally closed (N.C.) type when the valve is off, and its detailed electrical specifications for various loads (non-inductive, inductive, lamp, motor) are listed.\\n- **Physical Dimensions**: The document includes precise dimension drawings in millimeters for both valve models, detailing mounting holes, port sizes, and overall size.\",\n    \"notes\": [\n      \"The integrated limit switch is manufactured by Omron Corporation, model D4E-1C20N.\",\n      \"The valve's wetted parts (New PFA body, PTFE diaphragm) are designed for use with high-purity and corrosive fluids.\",\n      \"The limit switch is normally closed (N.C.) when the valve is in the 'off' position.\",\n      \"The product is assembled and packaged in a clean room, consistent with high purity chemical valve standards.\"\n    ],\n    \"characters\": 3724,\n    \"version\": null\n  }\n}\n```"}],"role":"model"},"finish_reason":"STOP","index":0}],"model_version":"gemini-2.5-pro","response_id":"WAzAaLKZKvuRmtkPldzdsQM","usage_metadata":{"candidates_token_count":488,"prompt_token_count":67496,"prompt_tokens_details":[{"modality":"TEXT","token_count":2996},{"modality":"DOCUMENT","token_count":64500}],"thoughts_token_count":553,"total_token_count":68537},"automatic_function_calling_history":[]}
