{"parts":[{"function_response":{"name":"file_qa_agent","response":{"result":"Based on the provided document, here are the specifications for the High Purity Chemical Valve model LVA20-02-C-X33:\n\n*   **Series:** LVA20 (LVA.pdf, p. 1)\n*   **Port Size:** 1/4 (LVA.pdf, p. 1)\n*   **Valve Type:** N.C. (Normally Closed) (LVA.pdf, p. 1)\n*   **Fluid:** Air, Water, Oil, Chemicals (LVA.pdf, p. 1)\n*   **Operating Pressure Range:** 0 to 1.0 MPa (LVA.pdf, p. 1)\n*   **Proof Pressure:** 1.5 MPa (LVA.pdf, p. 1)\n*   **Orifice Diameter:** 6 mm (LVA.pdf, p. 1)\n*   **Effective Area (Cv factor):** 10 mm² (0.5) (LVA.pdf, p. 1)\n*   **Ambient and Fluid Temperature:** 0 to 60°C (LVA.pdf, p. 1)\n*   **Response Time (at 0.5 MPa):** 25 ms or less (ON), 30 ms or less (OFF) (LVA.pdf, p. 1)\n*   **Wetted Parts Material:**\n    *   Body/Adapter: New PFA\n    *   Diaphragm: PTFE\n    *   O-ring: FKM (Fluororubber) due to the -X33 option\n    *   Valve, Plate: PFA\n    *   Spring: SUS304 (LVA.pdf, p. 1)"}}}],"role":"user"}
