{"parts":[{"function_response":{"name":"document_ingestion_agent","response":{"result":"```json\n{\n  \"artifact_e-84810e9f-b69d-4e32-8c3b-f4acb2e9cc7e_13\": {\n    \"mime_type\": \"application/pdf\",\n    \"summary\": \"This document provides detailed specifications for SMC's Air Operated Valves with integrated Limit Switches, models LVA20-02-C-X33 and LVA30-03-C-X22. \\n- **Primary Feature**: The valves are equipped with a compact Omron limit switch (D4E-1C20N) to confirm the valve's opening and closing status.\\n- **Models Covered**: Specifications are provided for two models, LVA20 with a Ø4mm orifice and LVA30 with a Ø8mm orifice.\\n- **Operational Parameters**: Key valve specifications include an operation pressure of 0 to 0.5MPa, a pilot pressure of 0.3 to 0.5MPa, and suitability for fluids like deionized water, chemical fluids, and inert gases.\\n- **Materials**: The wetted parts are constructed from high-purity materials, specifically a PTFE diaphragm and a New PFA body.\\n- **Limit Switch Details**: The integrated limit switch is a normally closed (N.C.) type when the valve is off, and its detailed electrical specifications for various loads (non-inductive, inductive, lamp, motor) are listed.\\n- **Physical Dimensions**: The document includes precise dimension drawings in millimeters for both valve models, detailing mounting holes, port sizes, and overall size.\",\n    \"notes\": [\n      \"The integrated limit switch is manufactured by Omron Corporation, model D4E-1C20N.\",\n      \"The valve's wetted parts (New PFA body, PTFE diaphragm) are designed for use with high-purity and corrosive fluids.\",\n      \"The limit switch is normally closed (N.C.) when the valve is in the 'off' position.\",\n      \"The product is assembled and packaged in a clean room, consistent with high purity chemical valve standards.\"\n    ],\n    \"characters\": 3724,\n    \"version\": null\n  }\n}\n```"}}}],"role":"user"}
